flowchart LR
    RA[Verified allocation and actual frame slots] --> E[x86_64.c emits original bytes]
    E --> P[After push and frame-base move: CFA rules]
    E --> S[After each callee-saved store or restore: register rule]
    E --> R[Each leave and return: epilogue state]
    P --> F[debug_frame.c: DWARF v4 CIE and function FDE]
    S --> F
    R --> F
    F --> O[Owned debug section bytes and address/section fixups]
    H[Owned IR function locations and source-manager expansion identities] --> ROW[Actual instruction offsets and prologue boundary]
    E --> ROW
    ROW --> LINE[debug_line.c: logical file, line and column sequences]
    H --> DIE[CU and subprogram declaration, range and frame-base entries]
    LINE --> O
    DIE --> O
    O --> ELF[elf64.c: original ELF sections and relocations]
    O --> ASM[assembly.c: same bytes and relocations]
    ELF --> LINK[System linker combines translation units]
    LINK --> G[GDB source breakpoint, stepping and DWARF backtrace]
    ASM --> CHECK[LLVM assembler and independent byte/relocation comparison]
